    <sys:String x:Key="Safety.AskEnable" xml:space="preserve">Windows System Protection is turned off. Without it, no restore point can be created before the changes.

Yes: turn on System Protection and create a point (recommended)
No: continue without a restore point
Cancel: change nothing

Every previous value is saved by the app in any case.</sys:String>
